{
  "_description": "F001: the final SpectralEarth pretraining of the next Indradhanu - E005's configuration (reduced-attention stem, width weighting, band-list augmentation 0.8, +/-3 nm jitter), 200 epochs on one cosine schedule, training data rotated every 20 epochs through 10 blocks of 200 shards (30,000 patches each; rotate_f001.sh), early stopping off, validation on the same 1,500 test patches as E001-E005.",
